{
 "_": "Kenney stand-ins for stock materials an imported map's .bsp did not carry. First match wins (String.match globs, lowercase material names). 'none' keeps the tinted prototype grid. 'units' is the world WIDTH of one tile (its height is units * 'aspect', the image's height over width) in Source units; 'mean' is the stand-in's average sRGB colour, which the tint toward the map's measured colour divides by. Chosen 2026-10-04 by looking at private reference copies of the originals; those never enter this repository. [g2g-maps-stock-1]",
